<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Burmah Castrol.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Burmah Castrol.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lubricants group Burmah Castrol Plc was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the U.S. investment bank said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The stock was down 11p at 10.21-1/2 by 1203 GMT.</p>
<p>Further details of reasons for the Goldman downgrade were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
